      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can confirm this with my avatar too. Happens when I am in crawl position for longer time (>20mins).\n\nI can also confirm it for a second attempt with a different avatar after 20 minutes (avtr_ebc57d73-dbb6-4540-9197-69f03d9a56cd).\n\nAnother one had not this issue.",
