  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Start VRChat in Desktop Mode\n\n2. Join world\n\n3. crawl down with some avatar.\n\n4. Wait for some time.\n\n5. Press WASD to see if the crawlanimation stopped working.\n\nThis is a very old Bug that pretty much always occurs with any Avatar we have tried so far.\n\nThe Time until this happens might be different though. Its not clear what causes it.\n\nI noticed that when it starts happening, the first thing that stops working is straight movement animations. So when only pressing W or A or S or D.\n\nIf you move diagonal it initially still works. If it starts happening, first the movement becomes erratic. like 1 seconds the animation plays for a bit, then stops for another second. Until the whole crawling animation stops working.\n\nThis is also visible for remote players. Not only locally.\n\nTo fix it, just stand up and move a bit. After that, crawling animation works again for some time.",
